2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495368 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:48 *** TC_26_6_5_2_1: Non-synchronised Handover to Frequency Hopping Channel ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495384 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:49 "*** Reference: GSM 04.08 " & char(0, 0, 0, 167) & " 26.6.5.2.1                                     ***"
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495412 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:50 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495426 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:51 *** PURPOSE:                                                                ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495445 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:52 ***   Verify that MS correctly performs non-synchronised (asynchronous)     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495457 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:53 ***   handover from a non-hopping SDCCH to a frequency-hopping TCH/F,       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495468 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:54 ***   including:                                                             ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495480 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:55 ***     - Continuous access burst transmission until PHYSICAL INFO received ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495491 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:56 ***     - Correct Timing Advance and Starting Time handling                 ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495502 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:57 ***     - Correct new channel activation                                    ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495513 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:58 ***     - Layer 3 message retransmission after handover completion          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495524 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:59 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495536 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:61 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495547 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:62 *** INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITATION ANALYSIS                                      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495558 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:63 ==============================================================================
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495569 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:65 --- LIMIT-1: Frequency Hopping (FH) Not Supported in Virtual PHY ---
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495581 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:66 *** The target channel for this handover is a frequency-hopping TCH/F.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495592 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:67 *** Spec line [5] +FullRateCh_B_1 uses FreqTCHb_hof3 (hopping config).     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495603 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:68 *** Spec line [10] +ltree_sendHoCMD sends HandOverCmd_fh with:             ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495615 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:69 ***   - TSPX_HSN (Hopping Sequence Number)                                  ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495620 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:70 ***   - Freqchseq_06 / Frql_20_B5d (frequency hopping sequence lists)      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495623 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:71 *** Comment at line 187: 'HO from SDCCH/4_nonFH to TCH/F_FH'               ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495627 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:72 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495631 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:73 *** osmo-virtphy (src/virt_phy/src/l1ctl_sap.c, line ~560) contains:       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495635 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:74 ***   OSMO_ASSERT(est_req->h == 0);  /* no hopping support */               ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495642 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:75 *** Any attempt to activate a frequency-hopping channel (h=1) triggers      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495645 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:76 *** an immediate assertion crash of the virtual PHY process.                ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495649 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:77 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495652 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:78 *** Real frequency hopping requires:                                        ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495656 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:79 ***   - RF hardware with synchronized frequency synthesizer                 ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495659 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:80 ***   - TDMA frame-accurate hopping sequence generation                     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495663 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:81 ***   - Physical RF carrier switching at 217 hops/second                    ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495666 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:82 *** None of these are possible in the GSMTAP-based virtual environment.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495670 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:84 --- LIMIT-2: Multi-Cell Handover Infrastructure Not Available ---
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495674 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:85 *** Spec line [4] +StartCellB_ho starts a second cell (Cell B) for HO.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495677 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:86 *** Non-synchronised handover requires:                                     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495681 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:87 ***   - Two independent BTS instances (Cell A + Cell B)                     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495685 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:88 ***   - Frame-level timing offset management (non-coincident timeslots)     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495688 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:89 ***   - Spec comment line 42: 'The timeslots of Cells A and B are not      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495693 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:90 ***     coincident at the antenna connector.'                               ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495697 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:91 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495700 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:92 *** Current infrastructure: single osmo-bts-virtual + single virtphy.       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495703 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:93 *** No mechanism exists to instantiate or coordinate a second BTS cell.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495707 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:94 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495711 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:95 *** OM_StartCell() operations in the spec require BSC-level cell activation ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495714 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:96 *** control not exposed via the MSC stub interface. The bsc-stub does not   ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495718 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:97 *** implement multi-cell coordination or second-BTS channel activation.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495721 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:99 --- LIMIT-3: Physical Layer Access Burst Monitoring Unavailable ---
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495725 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:100 *** Purpose 1: Verify MS 'continuously sends access bursts on the main      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495728 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:101 ***   DCCH until it receives a PHYSICAL INFORMATION from the SS.'           ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495732 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:102 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495735 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:103 *** This requires:                                                           ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495738 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:104 ***   - Capturing raw access bursts at the physical layer                   ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495742 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:105 ***   - Frame-accurate timing verification of burst repetition               ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495746 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:106 ***   - Precise injection of PHYSICAL INFORMATION message at L1              ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495757 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:107 ***   - Measuring MS response within sub-millisecond timing windows          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495761 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:108 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495764 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:109 *** osmo-virtphy does not maintain a real TDMA frame clock. GSMTAP packet   ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495768 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:110 *** timestamps lack the precision needed for frame-level burst timing       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495772 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:111 *** verification. Physical layer message injection (PHYSICAL INFORMATION)   ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495775 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:112 *** is not supported in the virtual environment.                             ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495778 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:114 --- LIMIT-4: Asynchronous Handover Timing Coordination ---
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495782 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:115 "*** Spec line [5] +FullRateCh_B_1( C_Asynho, ... ) " & char(0, 0, 32, 20) & " asynchronous handover. ***"
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495791 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:116 *** Non-synchronised handover requires:                                     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495796 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:117 ***   - TimingAdv(20) on Cell B vs TimingAdv(30) on Cell A                  ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495799 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:118 ***   - Frame offset coordination (line 39: TSPX_k, frame_offset parameter) ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495803 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:119 ***   - Starting Time IE processing to align channel activation              ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495807 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:120 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495810 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:121 *** virtphy has no concept of inter-cell frame timing offsets. It cannot    ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495814 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:122 *** emulate a scenario where two cells have non-coincident TDMA frames.     ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495817 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:124 --- LIMIT-5: Layer 3 Message Retransmission Verification (N(SD) Check) ---
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495838 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:125 *** Purpose 4 (spec line 121-124): Verify that the MS retransmits the      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495845 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:126 ***   last unacknowledged Layer 3 message (SETUP) after handover with       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495849 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:127 ***   the same send sequence number N(SD).                                  ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495853 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:128 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495857 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:129 *** Spec line [16]: L?DL_DatInSetup                                         ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495860 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:130 *** Spec line [17]: +SendSeqNo_chk (check N(SD) matches pre-handover value) ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495864 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:131 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495867 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:132 *** This requires:                                                           ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495872 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:133 ***   - Capturing L3 message before handover (SETUP not acknowledged)       ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495875 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:134 ***   - Successfully completing handover (blocked by LIMIT-1, LIMIT-2)      ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495879 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:135 ***   - Receiving retransmitted SETUP on new channel                        ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495883 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:136 ***   - Extracting and comparing N(SD) bit field from L3 header             ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495886 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:137 ***                                                                          ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495890 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:138 *** Since the handover itself cannot execute (FH crash + no multi-cell),    ***
2026/Jun/26 14:38:42.495896 USER TC_26_6_5_2_1.ttcn3:139 *** the retransmission verification path is unreachable.                     ***
